 decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain shrink-0 h-8 w-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Aar<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Ga</span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 md:flex\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/ecosystem\">Ecosystem</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/tech\">Tech Hub</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/interns\">Verified Interns</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glass transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/admin\">Founder Sign In<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><button aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 md:hidden\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Menu</span><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-transform \"></span><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-opacity \"></span><span class=\"block h-0.5 w-5 bg-ink transition-transform \"></span></div></button></div></header><div class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pt-28 pb-24 lg:px-8\"><header class=\"max-w-4xl\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600\">Ecosystem Command Center</span><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-balance\">One Ecosystem. Every Mission, One View.</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 text-balance\">A live, unified view of AarGa&#x27;s grassroots foundation operations and commercial enterprise SaaS platform running side-by-side on a single platform core.</p></header><section class=\"mt-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-moss-200 bg-moss-50/60 p-8 shadow-glass\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-moss-700\">Grassroots NGO Arm</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl\">AarGa Foundation</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">Empowering local cooperatives, field workers, and educational communities with zero-cost operational tools and skill-verification pathways.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-moss-200/60 pt-6\"><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">12</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">Partner organizations onboarded</div></div><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">40+</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">Active field deployments</div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 p-8 shadow-glass\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700\">Commercial SaaS Arm</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl\">AarGa Private Limited</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">Engineering high-availability SaaS infrastructure that powers enterprise workflows while directly funding foundation field deployments.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-emerald-200/60 pt-6\"><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">99.9%</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">Platform-wide uptime SLA</div></div><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink\">3</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">Products in GA</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600\">Platform Core</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl\">Core Products</h2></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/tech\">View full Tech Hub <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><a id=\"nexfix\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-moss-200/70 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(15,122,72,0.35)] md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#nexfix\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #0F7A48, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-moss-100 text-moss-800\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-moss-600\"></span>Operations &amp; Finance</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">GA</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">NexFix</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Dispatch and repair-network orchestration for hardware fleets.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.9%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">avg Resolve</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">6.2h</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">techs Active</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">3,400+</div></div></div></a><a id=\"exora\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-emerald-200/70 hover:shadow-glow-emerald md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#exora\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #10B981, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Secure Examinations &amp; Academic Integrity</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">GA</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Exora</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Impact analytics, proctored assessment, and integrity verification.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.95%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">dashboards</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">2,100+</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">data Points</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">48M/mo</div></div></div></a><a id=\"aarved\" class=\"bento-tile group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 glass p-6 shadow-glass ring-1 ring-gold-400/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(217,164,65,0.4)] md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2\" href=\"/tech#aarved\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-50\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #D9A441, transparent 70%)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-gold-400/20 text-gold-600\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span>Education &amp; Student Learning</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500\">Alpha</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">AarVed</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Interactive learning pathways, skill tracking, and student telemetry.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/70 pt-4 font-mono\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">uptime</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">99.8%</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">courses Live</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">42</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400\">students Enrolled</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">1,200+</div></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-24\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse-slow\"></span>Live Telemetry Bus</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl\">Cross-Platform Synergy &amp; Metrics</h2><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-2xl text-slate-600\">Real-time platform telemetry aggregated across foundation field sites and enterprise product nodes.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-glass\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Global Platform Uptime</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600\">99.9%</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500\">Aggregate SLA across database product nodes</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-glass\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Active Platform Services</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-3xl font-black text-moss-700\">2 / 3</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500\">Products in GA or public Beta status</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-glass\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Verified Talent Rate</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-3xl font-black text-ink\">100%</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500\">2 of 2 candidates credentialed</div></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-24\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600\">Pathways</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl\">Action Gateways</h2><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-2xl text-slate-600\">Select your entry point into the AarGa ecosystem.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-8 shadow-glass transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div><span class=\"inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800\">For Businesses</span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Enterprise SaaS Solutions</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Explore our high-availability product suites, infrastructure capabilities, and engineering architecture.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-glass transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/tech\">Explore Tech Hub<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-8 shadow-glass transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div><span class=\"inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-moss-100 text-moss-800\">For Students &amp; Candidates</span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Verified Talent &amp; Learning</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Join learning pathways in AarVed or view candidates scored by the VeriSkill telemetry engine.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-glass transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/interns\">View Interns Registry<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/70 p-8 shadow-glass transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div><span class=\"inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-gold-400/20 text-gold-600\">For NGO Partners</span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink\">Grassroots Foundation</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Partner with our foundation team to deploy zero-cost operational tools in your community.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-glass transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-moss-800\" href=\"/#mission\">Discover Mission<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white/60\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><img alt=\"AarGa Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain shrink-0 h-8 w-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Faarga-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Aar<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Ga</span></span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">One ecosystem, two missions: a grassroots NGO built to serve communities first, and a SaaS platform engineered to sustain that mission at scale.</p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500\">Ecosystem</h4><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/ecosystem\">Overview</a></li><li><a class=\"text-